{"title": "Shadow Druids", "pageid": 15989, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow_Druids", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Shadow Druids</b> are an isolationist faction of <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druids</a> operating out of Cloakwood, a forest south of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>. \n</p>\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png/64px-Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png/96px-Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png/128px-Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png/64px-Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Book_Tome_V_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">Balance is a myth. Where any clan treads, nature struggles.\n<p>Unity is a fiction. Men of mere flesh seek only to tame beast and raze flora.\n</p>\nWe are the thunder, and we are the rain. We shatter mankind, and grow new life in its place.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b><a href=\"/wiki/Faldorn%27s_Canticle:_The_Shadow_Druids%27_Doctrine\" title=\"Faldorn's Canticle: The Shadow Druids' Doctrine\">Faldorn's Canticle: The Shadow Druids' Doctrine</a></b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/30px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/45px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/60px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/30px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\">Kagha</a> - Potentially</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loic\" title=\"Loic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Loic.png/30px-Portrait_Loic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Loic.png/45px-Portrait_Loic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Loic.png/60px-Portrait_Loic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Loic.png/30px-Portrait_Loic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Loic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Loic\" title=\"Loic\">Loic</a> - Potentially</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Marcoryl\" title=\"Marcoryl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/i