e description of a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Letter_to_Kagha\" title=\"Letter to Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Letter_to_Kagha\" title=\"Letter to Kagha\">Letter to Kagha</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faldorn%27s_Canticle:_The_Shadow_Druids%27_Doctrine\" title=\"Faldorn's Canticle: The Shadow Druids' Doctrine\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Book_Tome_V_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for C