" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Secret_Societies_of_the_Sword_Coast:_Exposed\" title=\"Secret Societies of the Sword Coast: Exposed\">Secret Societies of the Sword Coast: Exposed</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Taking_the_Groves_Off_the_Table\" title=\"Taking the Groves Off the Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Book_Parchment_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Taking_the_Groves_Off_the_Table\" title=\"Taking the Groves Off the Table\">Taking the Groves Off the Table</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigate Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\">Investigate Kagha</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug\">Bug</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Olodan, Pinta, and Wren flee and do not join the potential fight against Kagha if their mouse form takes indirect damage (for example, from a fire surface) or if something neutral, like grease, is thrown at them. This is most likely a bug, as they still participate in the cutscene which plays when Kagha is confronted about the Shadow Druids. Direct damage, on the other hand, turns Kagha and the others hostile.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 372.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 370.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Dan Iorgulescu\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg/556px-Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg/835px-Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg/1113px-Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-iorgulescu.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Dan Iorgulescu\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dan-iorgulescu-baldurs-gate-3-shadow-druids-dan-io